      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KATES DYNASTY (4) finished 4.5 metres from the winner in third at Gloucester Park over 2130m last start at her first career run. Won't find this any harder and she can go right on with the job. CRUNCHYLOVER (9) has been in the placings two times from as many appearances this prep. Settled close to the pace and closed well to finish second last start over 2242m at Narrogin. Meets a comparable field and she can grab that well-deserved win. STYLE IN SPADES (1) is at the track for the first time. By Fly Like An Eagle and hails from the Peter Anderson stable. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Was not far away in a recent trial. Capable of taking this out. SOHO LOVEDAY (8) is stepping out for the first time. By Huntsville and hails from the Kim Prentice stable. Can settle just behind them and wait on the sprint lane. Looks to have some ability based on a recent trial win. Likely to attract plenty of interest from punters.",
